---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';
import TransitCalculator from '../components/TransitCalculator.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Burgas Airport Transfers (BOJ) & Transit | Burgas 2027 Guide" 
  description="How to get to Burgas 2027. Ultimate guide to Burgas airport transfers, Istanbul border crossing, and getting to the Arena."
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <h1 class="text-gradient">Transit & Logistics Playbook</h1>
    <p class="lead">Don't let logistics ruin your Eurovision experience. Here is the ultimate guide to Burgas airport transfers and getting around the coast.</p>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="main-column">
        <TransitCalculator />

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>✈️ Flying into Burgas (BOJ)</h2>
          <p>Burgas Airport is only 10 km from the city center. During the event week, expect high demand for official taxis.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Public Bus:</strong> Line No. 15 runs every 20-30 minutes. Costs ~1.50 BGN.</li>
            <li><strong>Official Taxi:</strong> Eko Taxi is the official airport partner.</li>
            <li><strong>Private Transfer:</strong> Highly recommended. Book a driver with a name sign to avoid waiting in line.</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Book Private Airport Transfer (KiwiTaxi)" href="https://kiwitaxi.com/" provider="kiwitaxi" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="intercity-buses">
          <h2>🚌 Intercity Buses (Sofia, Varna, Plovdiv & Istanbul)</h2>
          <p>If you fly into a different major city, taking a bus is the most affordable way to reach Burgas.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Sofia to Burgas:</strong> ~5 hours via the highway. Extremely popular route.</li>
            <li><strong>Plovdiv to Burgas:</strong> ~3.5 hours.</li>
            <li><strong>Varna to Burgas:</strong> ~2 hours along the scenic coastal road.</li>
            <li><strong>Istanbul (IST) to Burgas:</strong> ~4-5 hours depending on the Dereköy border crossing. Demand will be insane, book months in advance.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="insider-note">
            <strong>Insider Note:</strong> Use Omio or FlixBus to book tickets in advance. Local Bulgarian bus companies (like Union Ivkoni or Enturtrans) sell out very fast during summer events.
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Search Buses on Omio" href="https://www.omio.com/" provider="booking" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Check FlixBus Routes" href="https://www.flixbus.com/" provider="booking" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="rent-a-car">
          <h2>🚗 Rent a Car: The Ultimate Freedom</h2>
          <p>Don't just stay in your hotel room between Eurovision rehearsals and the Grand Final. Renting a car gives you the freedom to explore the entire coast, from the ancient ruins of Nessebar to the wild beaches south of Sozopol.</p>
          <p><em>Check out our <a href="/black-sea-experience" style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Black Sea Experience guide</a> to see where a car can take you.</em></p>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Compare Rental Prices (DiscoverCars)" href="https://www.discovercars.com/" provider="discovercars" />
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="glass-panel sticky-box">
          <h3>Secure Your Ride</h3>
          <p>Surge pricing will be in effect during Eurovision week. Book now.</p>
          
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Airport Transfer (KiwiTaxi)" href="https://kiwitaxi.com/" provider="kiwitaxi" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Rent a Car (DiscoverCars)" href="https://www.discovercars.com/" provider="discovercars" />
          </div>
          
          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />
          
          <h4>VIP Minivans</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">Need a Mercedes V-Class from Istanbul or Sofia for your delegation? Contact our local team directly.</p>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; display: inline-block;">Request VIP Quote</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .mb-4 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .insider-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .sticky-box {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .sticky-box h3, .sticky-box h4 {
    color: var(--accent-magenta);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
